        "read": false,
        "user_title": null,
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "If you've not been reading the comic book series Irredeemable look away from this thread now, I expect it to contain spoilers later. If you haven't been reading it, why not?\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n*CLAP* *CLAP* *CLAP*\n\nWell done Mr Waid, that is an excellent ending to the series, one of the best tie ins I have seen and completely unexpected despite being well telegraphed from the beginning by all the promotional material.\n\nI look forward to seeing how Incorruptible ends too (IMO the better of the two series)",
